"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[64909],{64909:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/the-vegetarian.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Vegetarian\\"\\n          author=\\"Han Kang\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Changbi\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2007-10-30\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788936433598\\"\\n          rating=4.5\\n          tags=\\"novel\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nIt was a somewhat difficult book for me. Not because the content is hard, but because the protagonist\'s painful emotions are well-revealed in the author\'s expressions and word choices.  \\nI felt a similar hardship as when I read ```Jung You-jeong```\'s <mark>28</mark> in the past.  \\n<br>\\nThe emotions felt by the husband, brother-in-law, and sister towards ```Yeong-hye``` are all different. There is no perspective of the protagonist ```Yeong-hye``` herself.  \\n<br>\\nThis work also seems to be a book that needs to be read several times.  \\n<br>\\nThe immersion and liveliness given by ```Han Kang```\'s expressions and word choices make me a bit afraid to read her other works.  \\nEspecially <mark>Human Acts</mark> seems like something I\'ll have to read with great determination."}')}}]);